t","componentType":"Product"}},{"data":{"item":{"id":null,"max":100,"score":89,"reviewCount":7,"positiveCount":7,"neutralCount":0,"negativeCount":0,"sentiment":"Generally favorable","url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc"}},"links":{"self":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/enshrouded/stats/web?componentName=critic-score-summary&componentDisplayName=Critic+Score+Summary&componentType=MetaScoreSummary"}},"meta":{"componentName":"critic-score-summary","componentDisplayName":"Critic Score Summary","componentType":"MetaScoreSummary"}},{"data":{"id":1400709655,"totalResults":7,"item":{"default":[{"quote":"Enshrouded is an exemplary entry into its genre, seamlessly combining survival crafting mechanics with ARPG exploration and progression and, in my humble opinion, delivering the best of both. While you can absolutely play the game solo, it’s even more fun with friends, scaling the adventure to your group rather than becoming too easy or outright demanding the extra hands on deck as some other survival-crafting titles do.","score":100,"url":"https://tryhardguides.com/enshrouded-review/","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Try Hard Guides","publicationSlug":"try-hard-guides","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Enshrouded has benefited immensely from two years in Early Access, emerging as one of the best survival crafting games in the business.","score":90,"url":"https://gamingbolt.com/enshrouded-1-0-review-finally-feels-complete","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"GamingBolt","publicationSlug":"gamingbolt","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Enshrouded has evolved into one of the most impressive survival games on PC. Its atmospheric open world, rewarding exploration and incredibly versatile voxel-based building system offer hundreds of hours of entertainment. The sheer freedom, variety and attention to detail make Enshrouded an outstanding survival sandbox.","score":90,"url":"https://www.pcgames.de/Enshrouded-Spiel-74267/Tests/Release-Minecraft-Test-Review-PS5-Update-1556659/","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"PC Games","publicationSlug":"pc-games","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"With its amazing game world and a building system on par with Minecraft, Enshrouded has joined the elite ranks of the survival genre. On top of that, it has plenty to offer fans of action RPGs.","score":90,"url":"https://www.4p.de/test/enshrouded-im-test-review-wertung-meinung-das-fast-perfekte-survival-spiel-fuer-rollenspielfans/3435935 ","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"4P.de","publicationSlug":"4pde","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Quotation forthcoming.","score":87,"url":"https://www.gamestar.de/artikel/enshrouded-1-0-test-steam-review,3461120.html","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"GameStar","publicationSlug":"gamestar","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Without reinventing the survival game formula, Enshrouded stands out as the most memorable title in the genre for us, despite fierce competition. It is beautiful, open, and rich, offering a variety of content to explore either solo or with friends. While the combat still lacks a bit of depth and the voxel-based world shows its limitations, the possibilities offered by the building—and destruction—systems more than make up for it. This makes it the perfect title for RPG fans looking to try out a different genre without feeling too far out of their element.","score":85,"url":"https://www.jeuxvideo.com/test/2107389/enshrouded-1-0-la-nouvelle-reference-du-jeu-de-survie.htm","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Jeuxvideo.com","publicationSlug":"jeuxvideocom","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Enshrouded is a good example of the evolution of modern survival games. It places the exploration and player freedom front and centre and puts survival and repetition into the background. The game understands that what many people want is to explore and shape the world and not work a second job. This makes \"Enshrouded\" one of the best games in the survival genres for fans of Action RPGs and even solo players, while fans of more traditional titles will still find plenty to love and dig into here.","score":85,"url":"https://www.games.ch/enshrouded/test/review-mhiag/","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"GAMES.CH","publicationSlug":"gamesch","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"}],"positive":[{"quote":"Enshrouded is an exemplary entry into its genre, seamlessly combining survival crafting mechanics with ARPG exploration and progression and, in my humble opinion, delivering the best of both. While you can absolutely play the game solo, it’s even more fun with friends, scaling the adventure to your group rather than becoming too easy or outright demanding the extra hands on deck as some other survival-crafting titles do.","score":100,"url":"https://tryhardguides.com/enshrouded-review/","date":"2026-10-14","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Try Hard Guides","publicationSlug":"try-hard-guides","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400709655,"type":"games","title":"Enshrouded","url":"/game/enshrouded/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/enshrouded/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":89},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400709655,"name":"Enshrouded"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Enshrouded has benefited immensely from two years in Early Access, emerging as one of the best survival crafting g